{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06267","headline":"游天竺寺 · 崔颢","name":"游天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登天竺山，山殿朝阳晓。\n厓泉争喷薄，江岫相萦绕。\n直上孤顶高，平看衆峰小。\n南州十二月，地暖冰雪少。\n青翠满寒山，藤萝覆冬沼。\n花龛瀑布侧，青壁石林杪。\n鸣钟集人天，施饭聚猨鸟。\n洗意归清净，澄心悟空了。\n始知世上人，万物一何扰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}